Error [jet.PrivateItem]: `pad` is private to module `text`
  --> tests/ui/vis_priv_item_module.jet:11:16
    |
 11 |     print(text.pad("hi"))
    |                ^^^
  --> tests/ui/vis_priv_item_module.jet:4:10
    |
  4 |     priv pad: fn(s: String) -> String { "  {s}" }
    |          ^^^ `pad` is declared `priv` here
 Why: A `priv` declaration is usable only inside the module that declares it and that module's children
 Fix: Use `pad` from inside `text`, or remove `priv` from it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0605
